---
// Quiz figure for the Go context quiz (post 08), set 02: handler goroutine and publish goroutine on one time axis.
// States the timings of the question's code only.
---
<div class="qfig-gq08ht">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 200" role="img" aria-label="Timeline from 0 to 50 ms with two lanes. The handler goroutine writes ok and returns at about 0 ms. The publish goroutine starts at 0 ms and the broker needs 50 ms.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq08ht-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two goroutines on one time axis</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai goroutine trên cùng một trục thời gian</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="0" y="62" class="qfig-gq08ht-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>handler</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>handler</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="130" y="44" width="14" height="28" rx="3" class="qfig-gq08ht-fill" />
    <text x="154" y="63" class="qfig-gq08ht-c">
      <tspan data-lang-en>writes ok, returns (about 0 ms)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ghi ok, return (khoảng 0 ms)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="0" y="112" class="qfig-gq08ht-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>publish goroutine</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>goroutine publish</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="130" y="94" width="430" height="28" rx="3" class="qfig-gq08ht-box" />
    <text x="345" y="113" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq08ht-c">
      <tspan data-lang-en>publish waits for the broker</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>publish chờ broker</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="130" x2="560" y1="140" y2="140" class="qfig-gq08ht-axis" />
    <line x1="130" x2="130" y1="134" y2="146" class="qfig-gq08ht-axis" />
    <line x1="560" x2="560" y1="134" y2="146" class="qfig-gq08ht-axis" />
    <text x="130" y="166" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq08ht-c">0 ms</text>
    <text x="560" y="166" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq08ht-c">50 ms</text>
    <text x="0" y="190" class="qfig-gq08ht-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Both goroutines start together; publish needs 50 ms.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai goroutine bắt đầu cùng lúc; publish cần 50 ms.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq08ht { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq08ht svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq08ht text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq08ht .qfig-gq08ht-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq08ht .qfig-gq08ht-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq08ht .qfig-gq08ht-c { fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq08ht-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq08ht-fill { fill: var(--act-3); }
  .qfig-gq08ht-axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
</style>
